# Copy to .env.local for local dev. NEVER commit real keys.
# Server-side only (read by api/architect.ts). Do not prefix with VITE_.
# On Vercel, set these in Project Settings > Environment Variables.
# Without a key the function answers 503 and the app uses its offline planner.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional: override the model the Palace Architect uses (default: claude-haiku-5-5,
# chosen for speed). claude-sonnet-5-5 is the larger, slower alternative.
ARCHITECT_MODEL=
# Optional: low (default), medium or high. Higher is slower. Use "none" only for a
# model that does not accept an effort level.
ARCHITECT_EFFORT=
# Optional: set to "adaptive" to let the Architect's model think before it writes.
# Off by default: it roughly doubles the wait and a second pass checks the images anyway.
ARCHITECT_THINKING=
